  "title": "Qin campaign against the Xiongnu in the Ordos",
  "summary": "Under the first emperor, the Qin general Meng Tian led a large army against the Xiongnu and took the Ordos region, a Xiongnu trade and pasture centre, in about 215-214 BCE. A wall was built to hold it. After Qin fell the Xiongnu, now united under Modun, retook the land.",
